window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Mariah Thorn wasn’t strong enough to save her parents. With her heart broken and her confidence shattered, she’s sent to live with a werewolf clan where she can be protected. Her plan to remain lost in the shadows takes a wrong turn when she’s alone with Joe Clinton under a full moon. Something about her draws him in, and that’s terrifying to Mariah, when all she wants to do is remain unnoticed. Joe Clinton loves the real Mariah Thorn, not the quiet girl who fades into the background of his clan. When assassins attack Clinton Hall, Mariah realizes she can’t hide forever. They’re after a moonstone connected to her family, and facing the assassins will bring her to truths she never wanted to know. Will the woman Joe Clinton loves prove her worth or will she lose everyone she cares about all over again?</p>"; 
